  "post_content": "<p>El nuevo equipo de f&uacute;tbol C.F. Racing Onda organiza&nbsp;hoy s&aacute;bado y ma&ntilde;ana en la sala La Cassola la&nbsp;I Convenci&oacute;n de Entrenadores de F&uacute;tbol, con un cartel muy completo de profesionales del deporte, para la metodolog&iacute;a de entrenamiento en el f&uacute;tbol de alto rendimiento.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/06/IMG_1170.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentado el acto el periodista deportivo de R&agrave;dio 9 en Castell&oacute;n Liberto Beltr&aacute;n y a continuaci&oacute;n ha entrado en materia el ondense Raimon Calpe.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1164.jpg\" alt=\"img_1164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1165.jpg\" alt=\"img_1165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1166.jpg\" alt=\"img_1166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1167.jpg\" alt=\"img_1167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1168.jpg\" alt=\"img_1168\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1169.jpg\" alt=\"img_1169\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1170.jpg\" alt=\"img_1170\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1171.jpg\" alt=\"img_1171\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1172.jpg\" alt=\"img_1172\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1173.jpg\" alt=\"img_1173\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1174.jpg\" alt=\"img_1174\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1175.jpg\" alt=\"img_1175\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1176.jpg\" alt=\"img_1176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1177.jpg\" alt=\"img_1177\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursentrenadorsracingonda/img_1178.jpg\" alt=\"img_1178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
